  "description": "Bounded Word conversion, document editing and templates for .NET. DOC/DOCX exchanges with PDF, HTML, RTF, Markdown, text and ebooks; XPS output, semantic PDF, previews and optional local English OCR. Explicit fidelity diagnostics.",
