  "releaseNotes": "Business-document automation and interoperability: bounded layout fidelity, document editing/composition/mail merge/templates, safe HTML and RTF exchange, optional Arabic typography, semantic PDF/UA, selected-page previews, digital PDF reconstruction and OCR metadata. Native font storage remains stable across garbage collections. PDF import/OCR, PNG previews and native typography require matching wordnet.Ocr. Bucket 5 is design-only. See the 1.2.0 release notes and qualification limits.",
